		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4987&amp;p=36379#p36379"><![CDATA[
The DM-8 battery is designed for the GA-510, and the two slots at the bottom of the DM-8 battery are narrower than on the original battery.<br>I've slightly enlarged the two slots with a cutter so that the battery will lock properly.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8321">F4DNF</a> — Sun Mar 23, 2025 6:47 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
